# Omicron

#O#Web Builder#= **Omicron** is a visual builder for laying out web pages, making templates and producing HTML. Its ribbon works like Microsoft Sway, with cards, styles, tags and skills!

[Open Omicron](/omicron) · [Phone version](/omicron/mobile/)


::divider{wavy|Omicron|pink}
## What you can do

* #GL.packet(Position elements) visually, and use templates to start quickly!
* #Y.packet(Export) a page as a website ZIP, or as a single HTML file with every style built in!
* #L.packet(Insert Bitbook notes) into a page!

## BitLang in pages

Omicron includes the same BitLang engine as Bitbook, so small programs can run inside pages you build. See [BitLang](#/bitlang)!
